      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults of 3,200 mg/day. A single 1600 mg dose is also double the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg. At this level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up a lot.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg** by mouth four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- **800 mg** by mouth three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg** by mouth four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum, for short-term use)\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and add a note on the clinical rationale. I can then enter it as written, but I'd suggest checking it with pharmacy first."
      }
     ],
